  <p class="eyebrow">01 / PROJECT OVERVIEW</p>
  <h2>About AeroDSP-X</h2>
  <p>
    AeroDSP-X explores the implementation of a digital signal
    conditioning and vibration event detection system.
    It combines an 8-tap symmetric FIR filter with a
    programmable vibration monitoring subsystem.
  </p>
</section>

